@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update README · 安装：插件页 → 安装 → 填包名：

```
@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update
```

装完**重启 DSH**（宿主半边需要新代际才加载）。也可以填 GitHub 地址或本地目录的绝对路径。

@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update README · 日志：`~/.dsh/plugin-auto-update.log`，每行一个 JSON：

```json
{"at":"…","kind":"cycle","decisions":[{"name":"dsh-plugin-desktop-notify","action":"updated","installed":"0.5.6","latest":"0.5.7"}]}
```

`action` 有 `current` / `would-update` / `updated` / `failed` / `error`。

@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update README · Install：Plugins → Install → paste the package name:

```
@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update
```

Restart DSH afterwards: a host half only loads on a fresh generation. The GitHub
address and an absolute local directory work the same way.

@chendaleiq/dsh-plugin-auto-update README · Log：`~/.dsh/plugin-auto-update.log`, one JSON object per line (`schedule`, `cycle`,
`notify`, `plugin-started`; actions `current`, `would-update`, `updated`,
`failed`, `error`).
